        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I want to play <i>that puzzle</i>—where you look at the numbers on the left and top and fill in the intersecting squares—forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a rainy café, you can quietly and endlessly immerse yourself in solving puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916230/extras/a6907199175c42006e1018311dd69155.avif?t=1756994630\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep solving puzzles and aim for a streak of correct answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose board sizes from 5×5 up to 40×30.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soothing sounds of a rainy café and gentle background music will keep you relaxed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy  over 100 Chats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916230/extras/b3d18ec59d7b24de36d761325419982f.avif?t=1756994630\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and watch the girls chat on their smartphones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a completely free game. <br>There are no ads or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Posting Videos and Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless the following prohibited activities are involved, anyone—individuals, companies, or organizations—can post or stream videos and images without prior notice, regardless of monetization or platform. <br>These guidelines may be updated from time to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not slander others, engage in political, religious, or anti-social activities, or spread false information.</p></li></ul>",
